2026-07-27T07:52:29.2418751Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2419538Z i /tmp/Rtmp0I9AFY/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2419880Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2420565Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2421090Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2421638Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2422428Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2423032Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2666019Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:29.2779680Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:29.3187926Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:29.3331140Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
